WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
<v Saitej>Okay everyone, thanks for joining. This is the kickoff for the Fresh Bakes client website. We have until the end of the month.</v>

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.000
<v Saitej>First, scope. The client asked about a mobile app too.</v>

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
<v Anu>Honestly I think a mobile app is too much for this budget and this timeline.</v>

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
<v Ravi>Agreed. A responsive website works on phones anyway.</v>

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
<v Saitej>Okay, decided: we drop the mobile app. Website only, and it must work well on phones.</v>

6
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.000
<v Saitej>Second, the homepage design. Priya, can you own the homepage design?</v>

7
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
<v Priya>Yes, I'll do the homepage design. I can have the first mockup by Monday.</v>

8
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.000
<v Saitej>Monday works. Ravi, you take the menu and ordering page?</v>

9
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:52.000
<v Ravi>Sure, I'll build the menu and ordering page. Give me until Friday the 20th.</v>

10
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:56.000
<v Saitej>Done. Anu, can you write the copy for all pages?</v>

11
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.000
<v Anu>I'll write the website copy by next Wednesday.</v>

12
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:05.000
<v Saitej>We also need someone to set up the hosting and the domain.</v>

13
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:08.000
<v Ravi>Hmm, I'm already on the menu page.</v>

14
00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:12.000
<v Saitej>Let's leave hosting open for now and come back to it.</v>

15
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:17.000
<v Priya>One question: does the client want online payments or just pickup orders?</v>

16
00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:21.000
<v Saitej>Good question, I don't know yet. I'll ask the client.</v>

17
00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:27.000
<v Saitej>We also decided the colour palette is warm brown and cream, matching their shop.</v>

18
00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:29.000
<v Anu>And the final launch date?</v>

19
00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:34.000
<v Saitej>Launch is on the 28th of November. That's fixed with the client.</v>

20
00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:37.000
<v Saitej>Great. Thanks all, see you next week.</v>
